{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the evil Professor, save the hidden kittens and find a home to live, safely ever after.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucifer's Grand Adventure is a 2d platformer where you navigate treacherous terrain by jumping, running and dashing. Some of the collectibles are hidden while others require skillful execution of the controls to access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features classic 2d gameplay with up to 6 possible saves. The game is very speedrun friendly and will have tools to help speedrunners. (timer, quick level/restart functionality)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Area 2: latest by end of Q3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Area 3: latest by end of Q4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Area 4: latest by end of Q1 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 1 patch with either a new level or reworked every 2 weeks until the release of 1.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I've been working as a software developer for 11 years and Lucifer's Grand Adventure is my first foray into game development. I hope you'll accompany/support me on the journey to make Lucifer's Grand adventure a successful game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712250?t=1751493382","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3712250?t=1751493382","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712250/e0629840286bc5e6b4b646d07160b7ba70a2041e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751493382","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712250/e0629840286bc5e6b4b646d07160b7ba70a2041e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751493382","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the evil Professor, save the hidden kittens and find a home to live, safely ever after.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucifer's Grand Adventure is a 2d platformer where you navigate treacherous terrain by jumping, running and dashing. Some of the collectibles are hidden while others require skillful execution of the controls to access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features classic 2d gameplay with up to 6 possible saves. The game is very speedrun friendly and will have tools to help speedrunners. (timer, quick level/restart functionality)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Area 2: latest by end of Q3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Area 3: latest by end of Q4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Area 4: latest by end of Q1 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At least 1 patch with either a new level or reworked every 2 weeks until the release of 1.0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I've been working as a software developer for 11 years and Lucifer's Grand Adventure is my first foray into game development. I hope you'll accompany/support me on the journey to make Lucifer's Grand adventure a successful game.</p>","developers":["Nibblycats"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712250/cd48b6acbecec67babf41fc044dfb14984d0e58d/header.jpg?t=1751493382","is_free":false,"linux_requi